    "body": "I think @Zambonifofex has conceded that his preference against using figcaption for attribution captions is just a personal preference. What remains is the confusion about what putting a footer inside a figure even means. (Or more generally, what putting a footer inside any element that is a sectioning root but is not sectioning content.) It might be worth straightening that out, to see if his preferred alternate pattern of using a footer makes any sense.\n",
